    "Changes the setting, then lights this button (Selected variant) and dims the other button of the pair (Default variant). When the page opens, the page's own blueprint lights the button that matches the saved setting. The three pairs on this page are written the same way; each changes the setting with a different node, which a component param cannot choose, so they are not one component.": "修改设置，然后把本按钮设为「选中」变体、把同组的另一个按钮设为「默认」变体。页面打开时，由页面自己的蓝图点亮与已保存设置相符的按钮。本页面的三组按钮写法相同；每组用不同的节点修改设置，组件参数无法选择节点，所以没有做成一个组件。",
