    "On": "开",
    "One blueprint for the BGM, Sound effects and Voice rows of the Config page: each row is an instance of this component and names its track in the Audio track param (bgm, sound or voice), which Get Component Param reads for the instance being run. To add a slider for another track, place this component in a row and set Audio track to that track's id. The slider's 0–100 becomes the volume's 0 to 1 (divide by 100). Memo keeps the value because one output can feed only one input, and two nodes use it here.": "「设置」页面的「BGM」「音效」「语音」三行共用这一个蓝图：每一行都是本组件的实例，并在「音轨」参数中填写自己的音轨（bgm、sound 或 voice），「获取组件参数」读取当前实例的这个值。要为其他音轨添加滑块，把本组件放进一行，并把「音轨」设为该音轨的 ID。滑块的 0–100 换算为音量的 0 到 1（除以 100）。一个输出只能接入一个输入，而这里有两个节点要用到这个值，所以先用「暂存」保存它。",
