    "The corridor": "走廊",
    "The delay is in milliseconds: the slider's 0–100 times 20 gives 0 to 2000. The number shows seconds with one decimal (divide by 100, round, divide by 10) followed by the seconds suffix, the localization key config.secondsSuffix, so it reads 3s in English and 3秒 in Chinese. Get Text sits on the execution wire because looking up a key takes a moment.": "等待时间以毫秒为单位：滑块的 0–100 乘以 20，得到 0 到 2000。数字以秒为单位显示一位小数（除以 100、四舍五入、再除以 10），后面接上秒的单位。单位来自本地化键 config.secondsSuffix，因此英文显示 3s，中文显示 3秒。查询键需要一点时间，所以「获取文本」接在执行线上。",
    "The delay is in milliseconds: the slider's 0–100 times 60 gives 0 to 6000. The number shows seconds with one decimal (divide by 100, round, divide by 10) followed by the seconds suffix, the localization key config.secondsSuffix, so it reads 3s in English and 3秒 in Chinese. Get Text sits on the execution wire because looking up a key takes a moment.": "等待时间以毫秒为单位：滑块的 0–100 乘以 60，得到 0 到 6000。数字以秒为单位显示一位小数（除以 100、四舍五入、再除以 10），后面接上秒的单位。单位来自本地化键 config.secondsSuffix，因此英文显示 3s，中文显示 3秒。查询键需要一点时间，所以「获取文本」接在执行线上。",
    "The line that was said here, wrapping onto a second row when it is long.": "这里是刚刚说过的那句话，太长的时候会折到第二行。",
    "The slider's 0–100 becomes the volume's 0 to 1 (divide by 100). Memo keeps the value because one output can feed only one input, and two nodes use it here. The three rows below are instances of the Volume slider component, which does the same for one audio track each. The master volume is not a track and is set with Set Global Volume, so this row keeps a blueprint of its own.": "滑块的 0–100 换算为音量的 0 到 1（除以 100）。一个输出只能接入一个输入，而这里有两个节点要用到这个值，所以先用「暂存」保存它。下面三行是「音量滑块」组件的实例，各自对一个音轨做同样的事。主音量不是音轨，要用「设置全局音量」设置，所以本行保留自己的蓝图。",
    "This list shows the CG entries of the Gallery panel on the left rail. A new project has none, so the list starts empty. A locked entry draws as a dark tile with a padlock; an Unlock Gallery node in the story unlocks it, and pressing an unlocked entry opens the picture full size.": "此列表显示左侧图标栏「画廊」面板中的 CG 条目。新项目没有条目，列表为空。锁定的条目显示为带锁的暗色格子，由故事中的 Unlock Gallery 节点解锁；点击已解锁的条目，以全尺寸打开图片。",
    "This list shows the music entries of the Gallery panel on the left rail. A new project has none, so the list starts empty. A locked row shows a padlock; playing the track in the story unlocks it, and pressing an unlocked row plays the track.": "此列表显示左侧图标栏「画廊」面板中的音乐条目。新项目没有条目，列表为空。锁定的行显示一把锁，故事中播放该曲目时解锁；点击已解锁的行，播放该曲目。",
    "This list shows the recollection entries of the Gallery panel on the left rail. A new project has none, so the list starts empty. A locked entry draws as a dark tile with a padlock; reaching its scene in the story unlocks it, and pressing an unlocked entry replays the scene.": "此列表显示左侧图标栏「画廊」面板中的回想条目。新项目没有条目，列表为空。锁定的条目显示为带锁的暗色格子，故事进入对应场景时解锁；点击已解锁的条目，重播该场景。",
    "This list shows the voice entries of the Gallery panel on the left rail. A new project has none, so the list starts empty. A locked row shows a padlock; hearing the line in the story unlocks it, and pressing an unlocked row plays the line.": "此列表显示左侧图标栏「画廊」面板中的语音条目。新项目没有条目，列表为空。锁定的行显示一把锁，故事中播放该对白时解锁；点击已解锁的行，播放该对白。",
