    "Two sounds for the presses that sound only on a condition: an unlocked scene card, CG or recollection entry plays confirm and a locked one stays silent, and the confirm dialog plays confirm on the answer that acts and back on the others. Those blueprints call these functions with Call Fn after their check. A sound that always plays when an element is pressed or hovered is set in that element's Sound section instead and needs no blueprint. Both kinds play on the SFX track, so the Sound effects slider on the Config page sets their volume.": "只在满足条件时才发声的按键使用这两种音效：已解锁的场景卡片、CG 或回想条目播放确认音，锁定的保持无声；确认对话框中执行操作的答案播放确认音，其余答案播放返回音。这些蓝图在判断之后用「调用函数」调用这里的函数。按下或悬停时总会播放的音效，在该元素的「音效」分区中设置，不需要蓝图。两者都在音效音轨上播放，音量由「设置」页面的「音效」滑块控制。",
